(7232945, 1118184, 58634, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to comment on this before rollover and I would''ve never imagined you''d score so low with such a beautiful image.... In hindsight, I can see how voters would''ve been looking for something that "screamed" long-exposure, but personally I couldn''t look away from this one; it was one of my favorites and (10''s).<br/> <br/>Beautiful all around..</td>', 'I didn''t get to comment on this before rollover and I would''ve never imagined you''d score so low with such a beautiful image.... In hindsight, I can see how voters would''ve been looking for something that "screamed" long-exposure, but personally I couldn''t look away from this one; it was one of my favorites and (10''s). Beautiful all around..', '2014-06-25 01:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
