(7232961, 1118052, 117534, '<td valign="top">I LOVED this, it should be wayyyy up towards the top. Try to make you pix larger next time  I size my final at 800 pix on the high side, and then save for web in Photoshop, if you don''t have PS do that size and then take the res to 72. That should keep your shot large and get under the 300 mg allowance for DPC .  I think that''s the ONLY reason this is placed so low.</td>', 'I LOVED this, it should be wayyyy up towards the top. Try to make you pix larger next time  I size my final at 800 pix on the high side, and then save for web in Photoshop, if you don''t have PS do that size and then take the res to 72. That should keep your shot large and get under the 300 mg allowance for DPC .  I think that''s the ONLY reason this is placed so low.', '2014-06-25 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 0),
