(7232970, 1117928, 58634, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how you scored so low as I find your image to be well above average.. possibly because a few other people also used IR and the voters got tired of it?<br/> <br/>I personally really liked the colors and tones, especially of the trees as it seemed to me they fit the "farm" scene well.</td>', 'I am not sure how you scored so low as I find your image to be well above average.. possibly because a few other people also used IR and the voters got tired of it? I personally really liked the colors and tones, especially of the trees as it seemed to me they fit the "farm" scene well.', '2014-06-25 02:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
