(7233147, 1118186, 43774, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue, I gave you a 10, you certainly deserved it. I didn''t know where this was, I haven''t seen Seattle from this vantage point in pictures before. It reminds me of OZ - the city on the hill. Or a castle on a hill - the individual skyscrapers making up the turrets of the castle. I''ve never seen to Seattle but it''s on my list of places to visit.</td>', 'Congrats on the blue, I gave you a 10, you certainly deserved it. I didn''t know where this was, I haven''t seen Seattle from this vantage point in pictures before. It reminds me of OZ - the city on the hill. Or a castle on a hill - the individual skyscrapers making up the turrets of the castle. I''ve never seen to Seattle but it''s on my list of places to visit.', '2014-06-25 12:24:48.000000', NULL, 0);
