(7233183, 1118007, 100831, '<td valign="top">I think this is better than it got credited for. I was your 8. Nice idea.</td>', 'I think this is better than it got credited for. I was your 8. Nice idea.', '2014-06-25 13:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
