(7233573, 1117976, 19825, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed shot. I am struck by how clean it is. The underbellies of the bridges around here are much scarier -- rusting steel and decaying concrete -- America''s crumbling infrastructure.</td>', 'Beautifully composed shot. I am struck by how clean it is. The underbellies of the bridges around here are much scarier -- rusting steel and decaying concrete -- America''s crumbling infrastructure.', '2014-06-26 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
